                                "sense_id": "20b786aa-210c-3e51-9265-5915d86e4090",
                                "text": "He wore gold-rimmed pince-nez, and had a curious impassivity of feature. It struck me that he might look natural on a stage, but was strangely out of place in real life."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dda07213-467c-49a0-95d1-ea3fec773598",
                                "sense_id": "20b786aa-210c-3e51-9265-5915d86e4090",
                                "text": "[T]hey were baffled by tears in moustached sixth-formers, by walls of impassivity in the Lower School, by silent conspiracies which nullified the rules."
                            }
